00: |Side Question (/btw) Card:                                                      |
01: |                                                                                |
02: |┃ /btw What is the difference between Elm architecture and standard             |
03: |┃ Bubbletea?                                                                    |
04: |┃                                                                               |
05: |┃   Bubbletea is Go's pure implementation of the Elm architecture (Model-       |
06: |┃   View-Update). State is never mutated across goroutines; instead, every      |
07: |┃   interaction produces a message dispatched through Update().                 |
08: |┃                                                                               |
09: |┃ Tab to expand · Enter/Esc to dismiss                                          |
10: |                                                                                |
11: |Storybook tip: Press Tab to toggle card expansion interactively                 |
